{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"Our game is played in real time. \nA short rest takes an actual hour. A long rest is typically taken when you leave the server for the day and is meant to represent an actual long rest. In other words, we have built in mechanic to help you take time off of the server. This game will cause many to invest deeply in their character. Don’t allow fear of missing out on the game to cause you to miss out on taking care of your life and your mental health.","created_at":"2020-08-26T21:49:46.352000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748298169648939068","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
