{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"so, i have 3 friends that are interested in game next year but have never really seen or played an RPG.  so I told them I would run a pseudo play by post sort of game over the next year once Roanoke was over.  So today they wanted to pick classes, one knew he wanted sorc, but the other two didn't quite know, so i gave them the door test.  Lets see i you all agree with where I placed them\n\nSetup, there is a closed door in front of you, what do you do?\n\nPerson A) \"I bash through it.\"  My follow-up question: did you use your foot, shoulder, portable ram, or a weapon?  their answer \"I use a big axe to go through the door\"\n\nSo with that answer, I suggested Barbarian\n\nperson 2: \"I wait around a bit to see if someone comes out, and if not, I walk off and do something else\" (they did not test the handle, pick a lock, or actually interact with the door at all, just wait and walk off)\n\nMy suggestion: Bard\n\nI love the door test to help people figure out what character to play","created_at":"2020-08-27T15:16:57.785000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748561703779958864","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
